        <!-- KeelBase runtime, embedded — the spike's whole point. / KeelBase 运行时，嵌入——本次 Spike 的全部意义。 -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>cn.com.keelbase</groupId>
            <artifactId>keelbase4j-core</artifactId>
            <version>0.1.14-SNAPSHOT</version>
        </dependency>

        <!-- KeelBase's Spring AI adapter — the model loop on KeelBase's **own** path. It implements the
             runtime's two seams (`ToolCallPlanner` for `/ai/chat`, `TaskRunner` for `/ai/task`) and
             activates only when a model is actually configured; with no provider it changes nothing and
             the runtime's own rule-based planner stays in charge. That condition is the whole point —
             the deterministic scenario gates below assert *which* tool ran, and a model would make that
             a guess. See `D26 ③`: the AI carrier is the host's, KeelBase governs on top of it.
             / KeelBase 的 Spring AI 适配器 —— KeelBase **自己**那条路径上的模型回路。它实现运行时那两条缝
             （`/ai/chat` 的 `ToolCallPlanner`、`/ai/task` 的 `TaskRunner`），且**只有真配了模型才激活**；不配
             provider 时它什么都不改，规则版 planner 继续执掌。那个条件是**要点**——下面那些确定性场景门禁断言的
             是**哪个**工具跑了，而模型会把这个变成猜。见 `D26 ③`：AI 载体是宿主的，KeelBase 只在其上施治理。 -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>cn.com.keelbase</groupId>
            <artifactId>keelbase4j-springai</artifactId>
            <version>0.1.14-SNAPSHOT</version>
        </dependency>

        <!-- The trace id the host writes beside its own logs and hands to the runtime for execution
             links. The monitor starter declares these as optional, so the host has to bring them in
             explicitly; without an SDK provider `TracerUtils` only ever returns an empty string.
             / 宿主写进自己的日志、并交给运行时做执行关联的 trace id。monitor starter 把它们声明为
             optional，故宿主必须显式引入；没有 SDK provider 时 `TracerUtils` 只会返回空串。 -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.opentelemetry</groupId>
            <artifactId>opentelemetry-api</artifactId>
        </dependency>
        <dependency>
            <groupId>io.opentelemetry</groupId>
            <artifactId>opentelemetry-sdk</artifactId>
        </dependency>

        <!-- The model that seam talks to, when it is switched on. KeelBase's adapter activates off a
             `ChatClient.Builder` bean, and this host has none of its own: `ai1` builds its OpenAI models
             per request from rows in its own tables (`Ai1LlmModelFactory`) rather than contributing one
             to the context. This starter brings the OpenAI model auto-configuration in; `run-server.sh`
             hands it the provider settings as parameters and hands it **none** by default.
             / 那条缝在打开时所对的模型。KeelBase 的适配器靠 `ChatClient.Builder` bean 激活，而本宿主**自己
             没有**这样一个 bean：`ai1` 是按它自己表里的行**逐请求**建 OpenAI 模型的（`Ai1LlmModelFactory`），
             而不是往容器里贡献一个。这个 starter 把 OpenAI 的模型自动配置带进来；`run-server.sh` 以参数交给它
             provider 设置、**默认一个都不给**。 -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.springframework.ai</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-ai-starter-model-openai</artifactId>
        </dependency>

        <!-- PostgreSQL driver. This line's datastore is PostgreSQL (see keelbase-docs/KEELBASE-DEV.md),
             and upstream builds for MySQL and manages no PostgreSQL driver — without this the platform
             fails at startup with `ClassNotFoundException: org.postgresql.Driver`, which is what the
             first run against PostgreSQL produced. The version is explicit because upstream's dependency
             management does not carry one.
             / PostgreSQL 驱动。本线的数据存储是 PostgreSQL（见 keelbase-docs/KEELBASE-DEV.md），而上游是按
             MySQL 构建的、**不管理任何 PG 驱动**——没有它，平台启动即以 `ClassNotFoundException:
             org.postgresql.Driver` 失败，这正是第一次对着 PG 跑出来的东西。版本写明，是因为上游的依赖管理里没有它。 -->
        <dependency>
            <groupId>org.postgresql</groupId>
            <artifactId>postgresql</artifactId>
            <version>42.7.13</version>
        </dependency>

